# =============================================================================
# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# Each application also has its own .gitignore for tooling specific to it:
#   frontend/  — Next.js and Node
#   backend/   — Maven and the JVM
# =============================================================================

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Secrets. Never commit a real environment file; commit `.env.example` instead.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
run.md